allback":"stroke-linejoin - SVG: Scalable Vector Graphics | MDN","id":2,"title":"stroke-linejoin - SVG: Scalable Vector Graphics | MDN","title_link":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/SVG/Attribute/stroke-linejoin","text":"« SVG 属性リファレンスホーム","image_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/mdn-social-share.0ca9dbda.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"developer.mozilla.org","service_icon":"https://developer.mozilla.org/apple-touch-icon.0ea0fa02.png","from_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/SVG/Attribute/stroke-linejoin","original_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/SVG/Attribute/stroke-linejoin"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o7=eI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b37112f9-c0c7-44d1-a18d-163210317f13","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"stroke は stroke で面倒くさくて、折れ曲がるときの線はどうやって補完するんですか、角度が急なときはどうするんですか、などの問題がある","ts":"1626423655.238700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GL4P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2d24011-616e-44e0-aa83-4e05ebe0e4c1","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"あー stroke 用の vertices は別になるのか… rename します","ts":"1626423418.237800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7J1d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34b0cd45-bbcf-4f8b-b12f-78ea9e3f063e","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"今 ArcTo を追加しようとしていて、これがおわったら多分 Path のコア的なものは一旦終わりかな","ts":"1626423396.237300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C5X8C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58a4564c-8324-46f6-82f0-08e111fbdbe9","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ヨシ!","ts":"1626423344.236300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yoshi","count":2,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yrur4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32313355-5138-4cc0-b62b-4ae95eda0b6c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"experimental なので破壊してしまった","ts":"1626423342.236100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZfeE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76338c6a-246d-4ee2-a377-4c5716daff20","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"はい","ts":"1626423337.235900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6F3/0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b447667-8095-4949-8b5b-fff53776bc07","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"おお　だいぶ変わってました\n\u003chttps://github.com/hajimehoshi/ebiten/blob/main/vector/path.go#L130-L165\u003e","ts":"1626423331.235500","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/hajimehoshi/ebiten/blob/main/vector/path.go | path.go\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/hajimehoshi/ebiten/blob/main/vector/path.go | path.go\u003e","text":"```\n// AppendVerticesAndIndices appends vertices and indices for this path and returns them.\n// AppendVerticesAndIndices works in a similar way to the built-in append function.\n// If the arguments are nils, AppendVerticesAndIndices returns new slices.\n//\n// The returned vertice's SrcX and SrcY are 0, and ColorR, ColorG, ColorB, and ColorA are 1.\n//\n// The returned values are intended to be passed to DrawTriangles or DrawTrianglesShader with EvenOdd option\n// in order to render a complex polygon like a concave polygon, a polygon with holes, or a self-intersecting polygon.\nfunc (p *Path) AppendVerticesAndIndices(vertices []ebiten.Vertex, indices []uint16) ([]ebiten.Vertex, []uint16) {\n\t// TODO: Add tests.\n\n\tvar base uint16\n\tfor _, seg := range p.segs {\n\t\tif len(seg) \u0026lt; 3 {\n\t\t\tcontinue\n\t\t}\n\t\tfor i, pt := range seg {\n\t\t\tvertices = append(vertices, ebiten.Vertex{\n\t\t\t\tDstX:   pt.x,\n\t\t\t\tDstY:   pt.y,\n\t\t\t\tSrcX:   0,\n\t\t\t\tSrcY:   0,\n\t\t\t\tColorR: 1,\n\t\t\t\tColorG: 1,\n\t\t\t\tColorB: 1,\n\t\t\t\tColorA: 1,\n\t\t\t})\n\t\t\tif i \u0026lt; 2 {\n\t\t\t\tcontinue\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tindices = append(indices, base, base+uint16(i-1), base+uint16(i))\n\t\t}\n\t\tbase += uint16(len(seg))\n\t}\n\treturn vertices, indices\n}\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/hajimehoshi/ebiten|hajimehoshi/ebiten\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tVJdh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99796fd5-b6b3-40ff-b847-ec20bc1a7bfc","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"最新実装だと AppendVerticesAndIndices があります","ts":"1626423282.235300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bVsa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e66a5fb-294d-4f23-88fe-eeedb4b0317f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Fill は消滅しました!","ts":"1626423253.235100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vd7Wr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"610f1817-5449-40e3-ace7-a4789e5d3663","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"でも自分で塗り方工夫するならFillでDrawTrianglesするんじゃなくてPathからvertices, indicesを得るメソッドが必要？\n\u003chttps://github.com/hajimehoshi/ebiten/blob/v2.1.3/vector/path.go#L145\u003e","ts":"1626423228.234800","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/hajimehoshi/ebiten/blob/v2.1.3/vector/path.go | path.go\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/hajimehoshi/ebiten/blob/v2.1.3/vector/path.go | path.go\u003e","text":"```\n\tdst.DrawTriangles(vertices, indices, emptySubImage, nil)\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/hajimehoshi/ebiten|hajimehoshi/ebiten\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original"